-- Carolina Field Almanac: DAILY temperature normals 1991-2020 for the Canadian and European stations (v0.29.3, team 2026-11-15).
-- Same use as CFANormals.lua (U.S., NOAA official): degree days for a crop already growing when CFA first saw it.
-- Method: NOAA's own (Arguez et al. 2012; NCEI "Daily Temperature Normals Methodology"): constrained harmonic fit, 6 harmonics,
-- least squares to each calendar day's raw 1991-2020 average, every month averaging exactly to the station's 1991-2020 monthly normal
-- (WMO-No.1203 5/3 rule). Daily records: NOAA GHCN-Daily (ECCC data) for Canada; IMGW (PL), DWD (DE), Met Office MIDAS (UK),
-- Met Eireann (IE), Meteo-France (FR) for Europe. Check run on 3 U.S. stations against NOAA official: within 0.7 F, corn GDD within 1.5 %.
-- One value per calendar day Jan 1 .. Dec 31 (Feb 29 left out), tenths of deg F. Generated - do not edit.
